  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "Researcher Jason Jorjani says on Jesse Michels' podcast that the daughter of Desmond Leslie, who wrote the book Flying Saucers Have Landed with George Adamski, told him her father always said it was Nazis who contacted Adamski. Adamski was a man who said that in the 1950s he met visitors from Venus. If true, it would mean those famous meetings with \"Venusians\" were really staged by humans."
